      <li>Copy <strong>{{ provider.primaryCode }}</strong></li>
      <li>Pick a country, regional, or world plan for your destination on UPeSIM</li>
      <li>Paste the code in the promo field at checkout and confirm the 10% price drop before paying</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="content-note">Discount shows before payment is completed.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Decision help -->
  <h2>Is UPeSIM the Right Pick for Your Trip</h2>
  <div class="decision-grid">
    <div class="decision-card decision-card--good">
      <h3>Good fit</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>You want to install the eSIM well ahead of a trip without it burning data early</li>
        <li>You'd rather a plan just expire than risk an unexpected auto-renewal charge</li>
        <li>24/7 support with a fast reply matters more to you than live chat specifically</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="decision-card decision-card--alt">
      <h3>Consider alternatives</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>You want a guaranteed refund if the eSIM doesn't work: see <a href="/alosim/">AloSIM</a>, which advertises one</li>
        <li>You're traveling more than 60 days out and don't want to remember to install closer to departure</li>
        <li>You just want the lowest per-GB price: check <a href="/redteago/">RedteaGO</a> or <a href="/airhub/">Airhub</a> first</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>
    For eSIM device compatibility, see our <a href="/compatible-devices/">eSIM compatible devices</a> guide.
  </p>

