  <!-- FAQ -->
  <h2>UPeSIM Promo Code FAQ</h2>
  <div class="content-faq">
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>What is the best code right now</h3>
      <p><strong>REDDIT10</strong>: 10% off all UPeSIM plans. ESIMDB10 and T-DEALZ-10 also give 10% if that one stops working.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>Does the plan start when I install the eSIM</h3>
      <p>No. It starts when your phone actually connects to the destination network, so installing before you fly doesn't cost you any validity days.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>Can an installed eSIM expire before I use it</h3>
      <p>Yes. UPeSIM's own FAQ says a profile that's installed but never activated goes stale after 60 days and shows as expired. Install closer to your trip if it's more than two months out.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>Does UPeSIM include calls or texts</h3>
      <p>No, it's data-only. Calls and SMS route through your home carrier's roaming rates instead. WhatsApp or Telegram over the data connection works as a substitute.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>Can I get a refund</h3>
      <p>UPeSIM doesn't publicly advertise a refund guarantee the way some competitors do, so treat a purchase as final once you've bought it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

